WEBVTT

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:13.900
Enough playing tag.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:19.590
Princess Saki, I have something I need to tell you about this youth.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:28.740
We will not be split apart, no matter what you might try!

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.490
Keep telling yourself that nonsense in your dreams, you brat!

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.500
You're a girl, ain't you!?

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:49.690
The towns entrance is adorned with a cow's skull

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:54.650
It's fine that the law is decided by the strongest,

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:59.640
But this simple feeling will not be enough to fulfill you

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:05.120
Everyone will definitely revolt and shortly disappear

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:10.210
That's a shocking bloody picture

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:15.550
I'm feeling nauseous

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:25.940
Holding my head, I board the subway

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:36.110
Righteous way of living, righteous way of dying

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:46.410
Who on earth knows or what the hell can show me?

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:56.840
Cold finger girl

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.990
Sit Down

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:24.510
W-What's the matter?

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:25.810
Princess Saki.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:28.750
This kid's name is Mikihisa Kyouko.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:30.810
She's a girl.

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:32.900
A girl?

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.040
It doesn't matter whether I'm a girl or a boy!

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:37.020
What's important is the feelings we have for each other!

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.440
I wonder about that.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.970
I love you!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.170
And you feel the same way, right?

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.980
We're bound by fate...

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:52.410
W-Wait!

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:59.060
In the vastness of the universe, there are things which only a man and a woman can do.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.840
But, that's...

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:05.510
Sorry. I prefer normal guys...

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:08.230
Two girls? That's just freaky.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:12.060
I'm sure you'll find your fated partner one day, Mikihisa!

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.520
My fated partner...

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:21.730
It's her... I know it.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:22.650
I really thought...

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.870
I do apologize, but I'll be returning to the mothership ahead of schedule.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.570
I see.

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:35.980
It is quite the shame...

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:40.380
I wish to consult the former queen about the proper response to this situation.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.780
Perhaps you simply ran into bad luck here on Earth.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:47.930
I'm sure that you'll find a much better partner soon, Princess Saki.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:50.810
I'd like to believe that, but...

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:54.590
Princess Saki...

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.570
Thank you for everything.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:10.190
She must be traumatized.

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.560
No kidding!

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.180
Can't make babies if your lover's also a girl!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.080
You have no decency.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:19.250
This is a matter of the continuation of their race.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.660
Not our problem.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:25.550
I wonder what they'll do now?

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:27.820
Will they search for another partner?

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:28.960
I do not know.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:33.130
Previously, I have never heard of a case where the Macbac have changed partners.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.870
I feel sorry for her.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.430
You never learn, do you.

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:40.980
You saw how she acted when she learned that Mikihisa was a girl, right?

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:44.410
You're wrong! I think Princess Saki is suffering...

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:46.650
When she realized it was a love that could never be realized...

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.360
Either way.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:51.430
Case closed.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:59.080
Currently on the Earth, hundreds of different aliens species fly in and out.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.330
Species that come in peace...

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.870
Aggressive, warlike species...

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:08.590
Different aliens with varying personalities live among us, maintaining a precarious balance.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.280
And now...

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:14.060
Has Earth been saved, or not?!

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:18.300
W-Why are you here?

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:20.900
When did you get back to Japan?

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:21.940
Look at this.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:25.180
It finally laid eggs, and now look what happened.

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:29.400
I bet it didn't think it would be infected with caterpillar fungus...

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:30.970
Prince!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.140
I just returned a moment ago.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:37.750
Craft-kun... You have something you should report to me, perhaps?

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.700
No. Nothing much.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.330
Oh?

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:46.130
Why did you hide the fact that the Macbac came to Earth?

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.010
H-How did you know?

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.050
I'm surprised as well.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.430
It is true that they are in mating season.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.630
And you are all in suits for a change.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.340
I was just setting you up for a little prank...

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.390
Sometimes I scare even myself.

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.280
Captain, you have done nothing wrong here.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.250
How did you know?

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.330
You're telling me it was just a hunch?

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.360
Craft-kun...

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:11.110
You used the house phone to make the hotel reservation, yes?

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:13.490
You've got it bugged?!

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:15.650
That's not nice. Please call it "record keeping".

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:17.930
You fucking bastard!

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:20.060
So they were searching for a husband?

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.660
Y-Yes...

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.280
I see.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:29.970
Princess...

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.310
I understand the situation.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:44.960
The issue has been completely taken care of!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.390
There is no role for you to play anymore!

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:49.110
But I don't think that's the case.

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:53.240
The Macbac race will not give up from something like that.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.890
But they definitely left.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.020
Yes...

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.220
The poor thing left, almost in tears...

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.120
Never trust the tears of a woman.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:08.130
That is one of the few truths that holds throughout the galaxy.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:12.880
That's...

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.160
A listening device?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.970
No way... back then?

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:23.810
Shit! I underestimated them!

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:27.290
Now that we've translated it,

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:31.110
basically everything they said was crap except the fact that she was a woman.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.550
They really didn't think much of us, did they?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.350
Well, they'd obviously try something.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:39.200
They're from Planet Dogura and also in the position of defending the Earth.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.330
I understand quite well.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:45.820
That bunch tried to block me from mating with an Earthling.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:49.700
Convincing me that my partner was female...

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.510
They've let down their guard.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.470
Crap! Where the hell did she go?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:01.220
For a rendezvous with Princess Saki, no doubt.

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:04.730
She passed a message in secret.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.440
But, why now?

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.700
Mikihisa Kyouko is a girl!

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:12.280
They just need to change her into a man.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.270
They can do that?

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:15.150
It's simple.

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:18.240
I used to be a woman myself.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:19.510
N...

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:20.160
No way!

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:21.990
Just kidding.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:26.820
You bastard!

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:29.190
Don't throw little jokes into the conversation!

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:34.630
My hypothesis is that this Mikihisa Kyouko person's brain is fairly close to a man's.

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.910
I'll get you for this!

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.710
You're mine, this time!

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.630
I'm seriously gonna kill you!

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:37.630
And you ain't never comin' back!

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:36.160
I see.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:36.970
So, that's it!

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:38.950
Captain, don't!

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:40.920
The brains of men and women are constructed differently.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.060
Please calm yourself!

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:45.650
The most vital area is the interstitial nucleus of the anterior hypothalamus, or INAH.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:49.660
That is where nerve nuclei are located that control male sexual behavior.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.640
If that section is as large of that of a normal male,

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.850
Mikihisa Kyouko has the mind of a man!

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.550
So what?!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:58.710
If her body's female, they can't have kids!

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.940
You can deal with the physical aspect easily.

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:03.410
But, when you consider the genetics...

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.000
Princess Saki is thinking this right now:

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:08.900
I, through which flows the great, prideful blood of the Macbac race,

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:12.500
have surely not committed a horrible mistake by loving someone of the same sex.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:15.100
Then, you think Mikihisa Kyouko is...

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:16.420
There is no mistaking it.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:20.130
Genetically as well, Mikihisa Kyouko is very close to being male.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.480
Search for her!

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:23.820
Find her!

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:30.000
I bet the Dogurian bunch are all in a tizzy right about now.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.840
But it is already too late.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.480
That person will fall into my hands, it's already decided.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.900
You seem to be having fun, Saki.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:40.350
The value of an achievement is measured by how difficult it is to accomplish.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.490
We don't really understand.

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:45.820
What's it feel like to love someone?

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:48.040
It was so wonderful, I was surprised...

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:51.150
It was similar to the feeling when you stab your prey to death.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.150
But on a whole other level.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.090
Was it like this for you as well, Mother?

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:59.090
About the same, yes.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:05.500
But you know, the feeling you will get after you mate will be even more wonderful.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:12.720
The feeling I had as I watched the race I had chosen slowly die out before my eyes was unmatched.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:17.110
A blissful time when I truly felt that I was Queen.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:21.280
You can experience this soon yourself, Saki.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.300
Captain, it looks like a snowmobile is missing!

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:28.480
What?!

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:34.750
In this snow the trail will have vanished, so who knows where she went?

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:39.950
11 PM, Shimo Forest Park.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.470
How do you know that?

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:45.170
I reconstructed the remains in the ashtray.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:49.640
If you want to dispose of evidence, make sure to break the ash into small pieces.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:05.540
Mikihisa Kyouko is, genetically speaking, immature; both male and female.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:09.890
So make a few changes here and there, and then...

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:15.110
It would surely be a trivial matter for the science of the Macbac race.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.630
Who are you?

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:26.350
Why do you have that?

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:29.600
Now... Princess Saki awaits.

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:40.670
Shit!

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:41.650
Where is she?

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.090
D-Damn!

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.470
It was no use, as I thought.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:01.540
You win!

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:08.150
As I thought...

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:12.520
It was only that she has yet to blossom into a man...

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:16.350
I'll fix that up real soon, my beloved.

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:34.980
We all have a new friend joining us today!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.940
This is Mikihisa Kyouko-chan!

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:45.220
Please call me Mikihisa, not Kyouko-chan!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.440
You're weird!

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:49.190
She uses the male pronoun even though she's a girl!

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:51.440
I think Kyouko-chan suits her fine!

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:00.250
Trying to kiss another girl?

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.220
You freak!

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:02.660
How dare you!

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:08.720
You're a girl, Mikihisa.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:10.750
I can only see you as a friend.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:13.300
Wait! No!

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:14.920
I'm a man!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.800
I'm a man, damn it!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.410
That's right.

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:21.450
You are not a woman.

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.090
You're...

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.510
I'm waiting for you, my fated one.

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:38.420
Huh?

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:45.760
My head feels kind of cloudy...

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.550
A muffler?

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.940
Why do I have this?

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:57.510
Crap, it's time for my shift!

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.550
She's actually pretty well developed...

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:02.910
Yeah...

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.930
Hey, where are you looking?!

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.860
I'm making sure!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:10.900
If she was operated on, aren't you curious about any changes to her body?

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:13.650
If you make too much noise, she'll notice you peeping.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.480
I'd rather not have the police called on us right at the start of the New Year.

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.400
Don't call us peeping toms!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.950
It's definitely true they did something.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:28.930
It will just take a little while for it to have an effect on her body.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.290
She'll slowly become a man, then?

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:34.660
In that case, we still have a chance!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.980
Is there a way to fix that brat?

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.110
I cannot be certain until I examine her.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.510
Hey, is the zouni ready yet?

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:42.470
This is your problem, too!

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:44.310
We have to come up with some counter plan!

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.410
It is not my style to get in the way of other's love.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.790
Now is not the time!

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:51.640
The very existence of humanity...

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:52.250
Here you go.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.970
This is what I've been waiting for!

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:55.020
Prince!

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.570
I guess it'll be my responsibility if they go extinct.

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.610
I've always wanted to know what it felt like being sentenced to death...

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:03.640
Ooh, look at the mochi stretch!

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:04.620
Yeah, right...

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:10.000
One limited-time-only New Year's herring roe pizza, and one boiled bean pizza.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:10.870
Thanks for waiting.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.840
Please, take your time.

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:19.220
No reaction at all, huh?

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:22.140
Her memories have been erased from the past few days.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:26.310
She likely doesn't remember Princess Saki, or the ski resort at all.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:28.220
Why would she do that?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:32.220
So she can redo the fated encounter once again.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:35.010
She's very picky about love at first sight, yes?

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:36.820
I can't even begin to fathom...

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:39.840
Two lifeforms with complimentary deficiencies and strengths

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:42.680
combine to form an improved genetic structure.

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:45.610
That is one scientific theory for love-at-first-sight.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:49.990
It is true that the chances of the offspring surpassing their parents could be raised...

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.900
Is that true?

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:54.690
It's a thoroughly debunked theory in the scientific community.

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.840
But they believe it.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:00.590
Falling in love at first sight is their way of testing.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:04.370
Who ordered this?

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:05.640
It's seriously gross.

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:06.890
<i>You</i> did!

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:11.020
So she's after her genes...

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:15.190
Are human's genes really worth that much?

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:19.630
Humans have only unlocked the meaning of a small fraction of their genes.

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:23.780
It would not be so surprising if there was a buried treasure in there somewhere waiting to be discovered.

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:28.990
Quite a number of extraterrestrials have appeared lately to steal samples.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:33.170
Then why don't why we take a little lesson from them?

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.380
It looks like I'll deliver it in time.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.330
So?

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:57.400
I suspsect that the vaccine I created will manage somehow.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.220
Wait.

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:03.670
Wouldn't it be a good idea to run a simulation first?

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.200
Understood.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:08.230
What's this?

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.780
There's been protection added!

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:14.730
If I'm not careful administering the vaccine, I'll cause an explosion of viruses in an instant!

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:15.660
What?!

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:20.830
When it comes to genetics, the Macbac contend for first or second place in the universe.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:26.820
By returning her to Earth, that shows they're confident we cannot cure her.

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:27.880
Sade!

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.520
It seems that way.

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.150
Shit!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.060
Phew, that was close.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.240
Wait? But, how?!

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:41.890
It was just 10 after!

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:43.240
Crap!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:48.740
All for that one damn kid, the entire Earth...

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:51.150
Is there no other way?

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.750
If we can't use a vaccine, then...

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:55.830
Shit.

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:20.520
I wonder what she's thinking about?

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:22.380
Like I care.

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:24.130
At this rate, there's only one thing to do...

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:25.710
Once and for all!

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:26.890
Captain, you mustn't!

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:27.630
Absolutely not!

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:28.990
Let me go!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.720
Killing humans is punishable by death!

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.870
We're screwed if humanity is destroyed anyway!

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:35.900
How am I supposed to make that choice?!

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.750
No need to.

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:40.460
What I am saying is that there is a solution to our situation.

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:41.580
Say what?!

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:43.750
Well, there is one little problem.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:46.210
How could it be worse than the one we've got now!

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:49.090
We've got to stop them, no matter what the method!

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:51.510
No matter what method, yes?

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:56.390
Uh, just for record, what method are you talking about?

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.440
Everything is proceeding as planned.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:09.440
The Dogurians tried something, but they seem to be out of options.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:11.450
How about Saki?

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:12.780
She's in the process of sleep-learning.

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.440
Language, lifestyle...

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.700
There's a lot she must learn, it must be tough on her.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:19.960
It will pay off.

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:23.210
In the end, a wonderful encounter will be waiting for her on Earth.

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:30.220
A few months later

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:04.830
My name is Mikihisa... What is your name?

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:06.840
How do you do?

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.510
My name is Saki.

00:20:13.050 --> 00:20:15.050
It went well...

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.850
Yes, it did.

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:20.720
Now all they need to do is hurry up and mate.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:24.500
The Macbac Queen only mates once.

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:27.000
Once she notices something is amiss, it'll be too late.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:30.020
Captain, the plan was a success.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:31.830
Shuddap!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.140
Still worried?

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:40.060
Making a clone of Mikihisa, transferring the same memories to him...

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:43.180
Programming an anti-virus, designed to invade and destroy

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:48.460
the evil viruses in the queen that will destroy humanity when they mate,

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:50.480
and injecting it into the clone's body...

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:51.790
Swapping the clone for the real one,

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:55.840
so that the actual Mikihisa Kyouko never falls in love with Princess Saki again,

00:20:55.840 --> 00:21:00.360
we played with his genes a little, and even moved him to a city far away!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.100
And modified his memories too, of course.

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:07.270
This incident alone is close to a third degree violation of intergalactic law.

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:09.600
We're in the company of serious criminals...

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:11.870
You have a better idea?

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.860
I've tried to think of one the whole time, but couldn't...

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:19.820
She can perpetuate her species, and humanity doesn't get destroyed.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.710
Mikihisa-kun gets to be the man he always wanted to be,

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:26.040
so as long as we can get over being self-conscious about what we've done,

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:27.180
I think this worked perfectly!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:31.660
You bastard actually thought of another way, didn't you?!

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:33.470
That's unfortunate...

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:37.440
After all, I chose the one which would weigh least on your conscience...

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.800
I knew it! There was another way!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:41.970
Spit it out! What was the other way?

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:43.660
You'll regret it when you hear it.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.660
I shouldn't have asked.

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:49.300
He's definitely devilspawn...

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:51.210
Captain, what method was it?

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:53.110
Leave it! I don't want to even say it!

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:54.940
I'll tell you.

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:56.200
First, you...

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:56.780
Don't say it!

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:02.370
Currently, human genes are facing a variety of crises.

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:05.280
Radiation, industrial waste...

00:22:05.280 --> 00:22:06.990
Unknown viruses...

00:22:07.270 --> 00:22:15.170
Humans may one day even try to change themselves into creatures invisible to various aliens!

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:20.650
It is a path that leads to inevitable destruction.

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:27.590
Are you ready?

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:38.100
Do not fear 'The Now' searching for something that can't be seen across this infinite distance

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:52.320
Under the hundred million glittering lights, I found you searching for your dream

00:22:52.320 --> 00:23:01.080
An infinite world filled with glass shards

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:13.140
Growing up I felt I knew many meaningless things

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:20.600
Shining like a jewel, you soar in the sky, no past, no future

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:25.940
The answer is beyond the sky

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:36.450
Do not fear 'The Dream', in a distant
place where truth and lies are unseen

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:52.180
Under the hundred million glittering lights, flowers sway in the wind

00:23:57.070 --> 00:24:00.780
A species on the brink of extinction, the twintail mermaid...

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:03.300
I'm an alien.

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:05.360
Note: Be careful not to lie.

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:05.780
We need your help!

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:07.820
Don't play around at a time like this!

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:08.480
Big liar.

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:09.090
Kill her?

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:10.930
No, I missed the vital organs.

00:24:10.930 --> 00:24:12.340
That's a lot of blood.

00:24:12.340 --> 00:24:13.350
I can't go along with this.

00:24:13.350 --> 00:24:14.130
You sure about this?

00:24:14.130 --> 00:24:16.590
It's fine. I'll just end up alone anyway.

00:24:16.590 --> 00:24:19.570
Next time: Boy meets girl

00:24:19.570 --> 00:24:20.910
Liar.
